# Packages in every profile (see scripts/profile.sh and profiles/*.packages).

# Web UI
luci
luci-ssl-openssl

# antoniocosta/unifi-openwrt's real, non-wpad dependencies (see
# docs/unifi-adoption.md): hostapd-utils for its runtime client deny list,
# kmod-nft-bridge for guest-network isolation, kmod-veth for its fast-roaming
# path. unifi-openwrt itself is not an OpenWrt feed package - see the README
# and docs/unifi-adoption.md for why it is installed after first boot instead
# of built into the image, and exactly how.
hostapd-utils
kmod-nft-bridge
kmod-veth

# SQM (Smart Queue Management): the package and the dynamic per-WAN queue
# config in overlays/common, shipped but left disabled until you set your
# real link speed - see docs/known-issues.md "SQM".
sqm-scripts
luci-app-sqm

# Diagnostics
htop
tcpdump
